flowchart LR
    U[Question, history, collection, prompt version] --> API[Authenticated POST /api/ask]
    API --> ROUTE{Message route}
    ROUTE -- Greeting --> PRE[Predefined reply]
    ROUTE -- General knowledge --> GEN[Gemini general prompt]
    ROUTE -- University policy --> RET[Category-specific document retrieval]
    RET --> EVID{Evidence usable?}
    EVID -- No --> GAP[Unsupported or clarification response]
    EVID -- Conflict --> CONFLICT[Conflict response with available sources]
    EVID -- Yes --> POLICY[Selected prompt and evidence to Gemini]
    POLICY --> VALIDATE[Validate JSON, source identity, exact quote, grounded answer]
    VALIDATE -->|Verified| CITED[Supported answer and source citation metadata]
    VALIDATE -->|Rejected| GAP
    GEN -->|Available| AI[General AI answer, no policy citations]
    GEN -->|Unavailable| ERR[Explicit service-unavailable error]
    POLICY -->|Unavailable| ERR
    PRE --> UI[Chat UI: response label and content]
    AI --> UI
    CITED --> UI
    CONFLICT --> UI
    GAP --> UI
    ERR --> UI
